{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Sally Comes Home", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "My Mementos", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 7, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 14, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Past Tense and Past Continuous tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Simple Past tense to talk about events that are finished. You use the Past Continuous to talk about events or an action that was happening at a time in the past.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Simple Past tense verbs can be regular or irregular.</p> Regular verbs end in <span class=\"strong\">-ed</span> or <span class=\"strong\">-ied</span>.</p> Irregular verbs change in different ways.</p> For Past Continuous, we add <span class=\"strong\">was/were</span> + verb\u201c<span class=\"strong\">ing</span>\u201d to verbs.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"try\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tried\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were trying\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"overcharge\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"overcharged\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were overcharging\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"say\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"said\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were saying\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"shake\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"shook\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were shaking\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"give\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"gave\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were giving\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"go\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"went\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were going\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"buy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bought\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were buying\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: I was going to pay the full price when the guide stopped me.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: I think the shop owner was trying to overcharge you. ", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "keychain", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an object you use to keep your keys together", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I bought this pyramid keychain in Cairo!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you hear in a conversation about a vacation.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "souvenir", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an item you keep as a reminder of a place or event", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The tourists bought a lot of souvenirs at the pyramids.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "tourist trap", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a shop that sells items, often overpriced, for tourists", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: A lot of shops near historical monuments are tourist traps.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to overcharge", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to make someone pay an excessive price for a service or an item", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I think the shop owner overcharged you for that keychain.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "delicacy", "type": "name"}, {"content": "expensive food, typical of a country or place, often used as a gift", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I tried caviar when I visited Russia. It's a delicacy!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "dates", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the fruit of the date palm tree", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Dates are a delicacy in many parts of the world.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob07aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "steeped", "type": "name"}, {"content": "filled with a particular quality", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The streets of Cairo are steeped in history.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob07aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to haggle ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to fight over the price of something ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Did you have to haggle to buy that keychain?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob07aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Write a dialogue with a partner (10-12 lines).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You want to buy a souvenir at a tourist shop.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The price is too high, so you decide to argue with the shop owner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Decide on a price and pay. Did the shop owner give you a discount? Did they overcharge you?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your dialogue aloud.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write a dialogue about travel and transportation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about what I was doing when something happened.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I compare things and prices.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I give an opinion.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn5le14ob07re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn5le14ob07re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: That's a nice keychain! Where did you get it?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I bought it in a souvenir shop near the pyramids.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: Those guys must be millionaires with all the visitors every day!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yeah, I guess ... The shop was a bit of a tourist trap, but I couldn't resist! Giza is steeped in history!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: Did you haggle over the price of that keychain?!"}, {"image": "engenn5le14ob07re2img02.jpg", "time": "19800", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Not at first. I was planning to pay the full price when the tour guide stopped me.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: Was the shop owner trying to overcharge you?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'm not sure ... I didn't understand what they were saying!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: How did it go in the end?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Very well I suppose! They smiled and shook hands!"}, {"image": "engenn5le14ob07re2img05.jpg", "time": "36300", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: Did the owner give you a discount? </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: He was going to, but  gave me a box of free dates instead! They're a delicacy!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: I still think he overcharged you ..."}], "audiosrc": "engenn5le14ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le14ob07re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "I can talk about things to do on a trip.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk or report about actions, events or people.  ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can say what I was doing when something else happened. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Do you buy a lot of souvenirs when you travel to a new place?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Do you collect a particular kind of souvenir?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Every holiday has a story!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": 